{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51995","headline":"五言早秋侍宴应诏 · 朱子奢","name":"五言早秋侍宴应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殿阁炎光尽，池台爽气归。\n荷香风里歇，树影日中衰。\n蝉声出林散，鸟路入云飞。\n承恩方未极，无田驻落晖。\n（见贵阳陈田影刻本日本尾张国真福寺藏唐卷子本《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗已收入张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》。\n《翰林学士集》收唐贞观间君臣唱和诗六十首，集名爲後人臆加。\n据拙考，此集实爲《许敬宗集》卷二的残卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱子奢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}